	order_index: 8
	quest_links: [ ]
	quests: [
		{
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#FF4D4D to=#FFB3B3 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>血液魔法</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>血液魔法靠的是 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>生命点</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，也就是 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>LP</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。你伤害自己，血液会填满一个 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>祭坛</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，而形成的血池会支付该模组所有其他功能的费用。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是本整合包中少数能永远回报你的模组之一，但几乎没人会去碰它。本章将改变这一现状。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[gap=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>你真正想要这个的原因</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>图腾</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>是永不耗尽的便携工具。无限水、无限岩浆、飞行、速度、磁力、物品自动修复。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Living Armour</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 始于铁，随后根据你的玩法进行自我训练。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Rituals</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 自动化整合包中繁琐的部分，包括你自己的LP供应。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>若佩戴</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>七咒戒指</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，你的铁质魔典法术将消耗</grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>LP</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>而非法力值。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 最后一个才是重点。对于被诅咒的戒指玩家来说，血祭坛不是可有可无的装饰，而是你的法力条。没有LP就没有法术。"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[gap=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>循环</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用一把 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>祭品匕首</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>刺伤自己，以填满一个 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>血祭坛</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>用那些LP购买 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>石板、 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>符文、 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>血球， </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>符文可以升级祭坛。更大的祭坛能解锁更好的石板、更好的球体和更好的玩具。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>重复直到第5级。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 此任务将游戏内书籍《Sanguine Scientiem》交予你。本章的每个多方块结构内部都有一个可旋转的3D预览。请使用它，而不是试图根据我的描述来建造。"
				""
				"[gap=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
			]
			disable_toast: true
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "ftbquests:custom_icon"
				tag: {
