		{
			dependencies: ["6AAB831CB3FB536A"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>炼金术台</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个用 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>LP</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 代替燃料的制造台。将 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>绑定血球</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放入右侧的槽位。该血球决定了要消耗谁的网络以及允许你使用哪些配方。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能制作出 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>秘术灰烬、 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>符文、 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>神油、 </grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>以及一堆提升生活质量的配方，比如腐肉变皮革和矿石产量翻倍等。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] `Orb Error` 表示你的球体等级过低，无法使用该配方。`Soul Network Error` 表示球体未与你绑定，或你的网络为空。右键球体以绑定。"
			]
			icon_scale: 1.2d
			id: "7CC2D826CA6BBDDB"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "407AD8FE2401C2DB"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 5
			}]
			size: 1.0d
			subtitle: "用LP驱动的合成系统"
			tasks: [{
				id: "33ECB0563BA9E2CB"
				item: "bloodmagic:alchemytable"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "炼金术台"
			x: 2.2573964076894697d
			y: 4.188558424592941d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7CC2D826CA6BBDDB"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>秘术灰烬</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键地面，使用 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Arcane Ashes</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 绘制阵列。每次绘制会消耗灰烬的 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>20</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 次使用次数之一。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>数组需要恰好两个物品，每次点击一个：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>基座</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>物品应放入第一个。如果有效，地面上的图案会发生变化。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>催化物</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>放第二格，然后阵列就会启动。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 模组里几乎所有的Sigil都是这样制作的。在JEI里查任何一个，都会显示给你具体的配方。"
			]
			id: "1F3B9803AFAEED5F"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
