			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>红石粉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和一块 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>空白石板</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放入炼金阵列。这是几乎所有人都会做的第一个符文。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键点击空气，</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>查看你的灵魂网络中有多少LP。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
