		{
			dependencies: ["45C16A2944338E77"]
			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>献祭符文之镜。每个都能将玩家损失的生命值转化为固定的 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>+10%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 经验值。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>那就是 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>祭品之刃</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，右键点击一个 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>血球</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，稍后还有 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>羽刃仪式</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 这些可以和 `Incense Altar` 的加成叠加，而自我牺牲真正开始优于刷怪的地方也正是在这里。"
