		{
			dependencies: ["6AAB831CB3FB536A"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>恶魔意志</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>与你的灵魂网络完全分离。意志是你随身携带的一种实体。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>灵魂陷阱</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 是线加上 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>500 LP</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放入一级祭坛。向敌对生物投掷一个，注意白色粒子，然后将其击杀。它会掉落 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>恶魔意志</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 掠夺会增加掉落意志的数量。"
				""
				"[!info] 陷阱只是权宜之计。尽快制作`Sentient Sword`，击杀任何敌对生物都能获得意志，完全不需要陷阱。"
			]
			icon: "bloodmagic:soulsnare"
			id: "506D48AD9FB2E89D"
