				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>恶魔意志与炼金术台相对应。将</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>酒石酸宝石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>放入宝石槽，即可从中抽取意志。</grad></shadow>"
