				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能制造出 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>酒石酸宝石、</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>智能工具、</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>投掷匕首、</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 还有 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>爆炸物包，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。 </grad></shadow>"
