		{
			dependencies: ["4B51189C36B8D291"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>三级血祭坛</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>20</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> Tier 2 戒指上还有更多符文，总计 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>28</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在二级环的每个边缘放置 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>5</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个血符文，向下一个方块，向外两个方块。 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在每个角上，从新环的正上方开始，堆叠任意实心方块，数量为 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>2</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将四根柱子的顶部各放置一个 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Glowstone Block</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 只有发光石帽是固定的。每个帽子下方的两个方块可以是任何非空气方块，所以用你背包里的东西来建造吧。"
				""
				"[!tip] 之后将 `Divination Sigil` 对准祭坛，确认其显示为 Tier 3，如果看起来不对劲，请使用 Sanguine Scientiem 中的 3D 模型。"
				""
				"[!success] Tier 3 是解锁 `Rituals` 的层级。这个层级将 Blood Magic 从点击自身转变为基础设施。"
			]
