			title: "仪式占卜者"
			x: -0.7877145203158236d
			y: 5.027638540236254d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5886C648D14180E1"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>炼金反应室</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>一个处理方块，顶部插槽放入一个</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>工具</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，它会执行该工具对应的操作：</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可作为普通熔炉使用。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>用合适的工具，矿石产量翻三倍！</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使用 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Sanguine Reverter</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 将饱和的陶土转化为 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>弱血碎片，这是唯一获取方式。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将血球和</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>强化符文</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>还原为其原材料。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 它和熔炉一样有方向性。工具放顶部，输入放侧面，输出从底部出来。放置漏斗前最好先了解这一点。"
				""
				"[!tip] 大多数ARC工具都会磨损。请为其附魔“不损坏”或“修补”。"
			]
