		{
			dependencies: ["5E2D15E4A410B5DA"]
			description: [
				"将 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Sanguine Reverter</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 放入 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Alchemical Reaction Chamber</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 的工具栏中，并用 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Saturated Tau</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 喂养。这是游戏中唯一获取 Weak Blood Shards 的方法。"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你需要它们来制作 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Master Blood Orb</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Greater Tartaric Gem</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 和 Tier 4 祭坛材料。</grad></shadow>"
