		{
			dependencies: ["25343A0C4C22AA60"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>四阶血祭坛</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>28</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> Tier 3 顶部有更多符文，总计 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>56</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在三级环的每个边缘放置 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>7</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个血符文，向下一个方块，向外两个方块。 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在每个角上，从新环的正上方开始，堆叠 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>4</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>个实心方块。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每根柱子顶部用 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>血石砖块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 或 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>大型血石砖块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>封顶，需要Tau。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 血红色科学仪器有3D模型。旋转它，数清符文，然后完全复制。"
				""
				"[!success] 第4阶段解锁 `Ritual Diviner [Dusk]`，从而解锁能让LP自我生成的仪式。"
			]
