				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>恶魔矿石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>可熔炼成</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>地狱锻造锭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。你需要它们来制作五级祭坛和首席魔导师的血球。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>复杂的炼狱锻造部件</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>能将你拥有的所有符文转变为它们的</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>强化版</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
