		{
			dependencies: ["42CDD69527871332"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>五阶血祭坛</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>52</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> Tier 4 顶部有更多符文，总计 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>108</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 个。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>在Tier 4环的每个边缘放置</grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>13个</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>血符文，向下一个方块，向外三个方块。</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8></grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每行两端各留一个方块的空隙。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将四个角各放置一个 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>地狱锻造方块</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 地狱锻造块，而非恶魔矿石块。一个地狱锻造块需要9个地狱锻造锭，所以四个角需要36个从恶魔领域恶魔矿石中熔炼的锭。任何带有意志属性的地狱锻造块都可以。"
				""
				"[!tip] 108个符文等于108个空白石板。如果你没有`痛苦之井`或`香炉祭坛`就来到这里，请返回去建造一个，手动操作不值得。"
			]
