		{
			dependencies: ["4B51189C36B8D291"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>共享灵魂网络</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>A </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>简易钥匙</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 加上 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>1,500 LP</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，放入一级祭坛中。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>右键单击以将键绑定到 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>你的</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>灵魂网络。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将绑定的钥匙交给朋友。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它们会将其放在副手或 Curios 的关键栏位中。</grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"4. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>他们现在绑定的任何东西都会从你的 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>LP中扣除，而不是他们的。</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!success] 在服务器上，这意味着一个人建造巨型祭坛和痛苦之井，其他人只需使用符文。完全不需要祭坛。"
			]
