		{
			dependencies: ["2CA28551F2A5B761"]
			description: ["<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>由 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Ethereal Slate</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>制成。给它任何方块，它就会覆盖上该方块的纹理，同时保持坚固，这样就能把箱子藏在墙里了。</grad></shadow>"]
