		{
			dependencies: ["7CC2D826CA6BBDDB"]
			description: ["<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>炼金术台产物。它是将普通铁质盔甲变为</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>活体盔甲</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>的阵列催化剂，也是用砧锤修复活体盔甲所需的材料。</grad></shadow>"]
			id: "751D7B1EDE27DD31"
			subtitle: "活体盔甲的催化剂（The catalyst for Living Armour）"
			tasks: [{
				id: "246897FCF76E5E50"
				item: "bloodmagic:reagentbinding"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "绑定试剂"
			x: 3.5d
			y: 5.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["751D7B1EDE27DD31"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>活体盔甲</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"1. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使用 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>秘术灰烬</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>绘制一个炼金阵列。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"2. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>使用 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>绑定试剂</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 作为催化剂。 </grad></shadow>"
				"[gap=3]"
				"3. <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>掉落一件普通的 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>铁质盔甲</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。你需要至少一颗内含意志的 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>普通酸葡萄宝石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>它能像铁一样提供保护，却拥有钻石的耐久度，还会监视你的一举一动。多冲刺，它会让你跑得更快。多挨打，它会让你变得更坚韧。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你将获得 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>100</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 升级点数可供使用。而 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Ritual of Living Evolution</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 会将上限提升至 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>300</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 点。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 按住潜行键并查看盔甲，了解它目前所学到的内容。"
				""
				"[!info] 降级需要消耗`负`点数。刻意削弱一项属性，可以换取另一项属性的巨大提升，最强的活体盔甲套装正是以此构建。"
			]
