			description: [
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>远程击杀可收集意志，每次开火消耗 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>1 点意志</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
