				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>香炉祭坛</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这是模组中早期最重要的升级，而且几乎不花什么成本。 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>4个石头</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>2个鹅卵石</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>、 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>1个木炭</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，还有你的 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>弱血球</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，这个会返还给你。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"放置后，站在其周围5格内。你的祭品刀会开始发光。右键并释放，你将一次性献祭掉比一颗心多得多、乘以宁静加成的生命值。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>培育奖励作物</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"在祭坛下方的3x3平台上，向四个基本方向各铺出三格宽的路径。路径附近的方块会增添宁静感。"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>完全没有路径会困住你 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>+20%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>木制小径</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>, 超出3个，上限为 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>+60%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>石径</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，5个环，上限为</grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>+120%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>磨损的石径</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，7个环，上限为</grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>+200%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>黑曜石之路</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，9个环，上限为 </grad><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>+300%</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>宁静有多种类型：植物、作物、树木、泥土、水、火和岩浆。每种类型在相加前都会开平方根，所以 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>多样性优于数量</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。一个池塘、一个小农场、几棵树和一个岩浆块，胜过一百根原木。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 手持 `Divination Sigil` 或 `Seer's Sigil` 并看向 Incense Altar。顶部数字是总 Tranquility，底部数字是你的当前加成。"
				""
				"[!success] 在+300%的极限下，单次献祭的LP价值是原来的四倍。正是这一点，让Tier 4和Tier 5从枯燥的劳作变成了轻松的午后时光。"
			]
			icon: "bloodmagic:incensealtar"
			id: "1A5C0E0B1D2E3F40"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "1A5C0E0B1D2E3F42"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "每次自我牺牲可获得最多4倍LP"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1A5C0E0B1D2E3F41"
				item: "bloodmagic:incensealtar"
				type: "item"
			}]
			title: "香炉祭坛"
			x: 0.5d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["60DD166366C21CAB"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>苦难之井</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>手动LP的终点。此仪式会伤害区域内所有生物，并将血液直接输送到附近的血祭坛。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>由 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Ritual Diviner [Dusk]</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 建造。每次仅与一个祭坛相连。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!tip] 对准一个生物农场或黑暗生成室，在连接的祭坛上投下一个血球，并在该祭坛上堆叠`Runes of Sacrifice`。你可以在做其他事情的同时，让你的灵魂网络自行填充。"
				""
				"[!info] 用这种方式击杀的怪物仍会掉落正常战利品，所以农场能给你双重回报。"
			]
			icon: "bloodmagic:masterritualstone"
			id: "1A5C0E0B1D2E3F50"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "1A5C0E0B1D2E3F52"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "再也不要刺伤自己了"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1A5C0E0B1D2E3F51"
				title: "建造一口苦难之井"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "苦难之井 (Well of Suffering)"
			x: -9.5d
			y: 0.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["60DD166366C21CAB"]
			description: [
				"## <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>羽毛刀仪式</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>最偷懒的选择。此仪式会反复切割内部的所有玩家，并将血液输送给附近的祭坛。完全不需要点击操作。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>还使用 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>Ritual Diviner [Dusk]</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>建造。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!danger] 这绝对会要了你的命。搭配`再生仪式`、再生效果，或者干脆不要在里面挂机，尤其是在只剩两颗心的时候。"
				""
				"[!tip] `Runes of Self Sacrifice` 适用于每一次切割，所以堆满它们的祭坛能将这变成一个非常快的LP引擎。"
			]
			icon: "bloodmagic:masterritualstone"
			id: "1A5C0E0B1D2E3F60"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "1A5C0E0B1D2E3F62"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 10
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "会自动对你造成伤害并吸取生命"
			tasks: [{
				id: "1A5C0E0B1D2E3F61"
				title: "建造羽毛刀仪式祭坛"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "羽毛刀仪式 (Ritual of the Feathered Knife)"
			x: -9.5d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7CC2D826CA6BBDDB"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>血红色炼金术士</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>你的炼金术台，但它在你睡着时也能工作。 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>所有配方它早已知晓，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>无一例外。 </grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>建造</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>地板由 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>大型血石砖</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>铺成，尺寸为三乘四。其中四块是控制器及其端口。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>顶部：</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>炼金术台，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>中间：</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>空白符文，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>周围：</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>空白符文，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>台子后面的方块要留空，那是另一半符文放置的位置。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 你需要一个可用的炼金术台来建造这个。没有捷径可走。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>喂食</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将试剂放入</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>物品端口</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每边六个槽位</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>生命精华</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7> 倒入精华端口，十桶储罐的精华</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>每次合成消耗5000 FE，储罐容量为二十万</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>速度和手动操作一样，一到十秒。你只需要不在场即可。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>它会返还物品</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>炼金物品原封不动。桶和瓶子会返还。作为组件使用的工具只会受到</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>一点伤害</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，和桌子一样。原本不会被消耗的物品，现在也不会被消耗。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 生命精华在此为流体。一桶等于一千LP。用祭坛将其导入。机器无法自行触及你的灵魂网络。"
				""
				"[!note] 在 JEI 中查找控制器以获取配方列表和建造布局。"
			]
			icon: "linggango_tweaks:sanguine_alembic"
			id: "4439BF4F7D1255F8"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "435E98B779D8534F"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "桌子开始震动起来 brrr"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "398A1B420A816410"
					item: "linggango_tweaks:sanguine_alembic"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "31D2FE8920826C26"
					item: "linggango_tweaks:sanguine_alembic_item_input"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "血色炼金术士工作台"
			x: 0.76d
			y: 4.19d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["20458B8987CD6CB9"]
			description: [
				"# <grad from=#E03131 to=#FF8787 f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>塔塔里克的熔炉</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>和蒸馏器一样，目标是地狱熔炉。有意识的齿轮、塔塔里宝石、匕首、充能物，全部建成，</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>无需你在一旁看着，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"---"
				"[间隔=5]"
				""
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>建造</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"控制器和端口需要三乘三的 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>大型血石砖</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。再在其上方铺上另一个三乘三的方块层。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"上层是中间有 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>地狱熔炉</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，前面有 </grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>恶魔结晶器</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>。其余部分用血石砖填充。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!info] 结晶器在作为墙壁的一部分时会持续生长晶体，并为所嵌入的机器提供能量。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>以意志为代价</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"<shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>这里没有宝石槽。它会直接吞噬</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>恶魔意志水晶，</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每个消耗五十点意志。</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"大多数配方所需的远少于五十，所以不会每次都消耗一个水晶。它消耗的数量与真实成本完全一致，在一次运行中会精确平衡。但在开始前，你仍需将一个水晶放在港口中。"
				""
				"[间隔=5]"
				"## <grad from=#FF9E1F to=#FFC46B f=0.6><shadow a=0.3>喂食</shadow></grad>"
				""
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>将组件和晶体放入</grad><grad from=#FF7B7B to=#FF3B3B f=0.8>物品端口</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>，每边六个槽位</grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFD98A to=#FFB347 f=0.8>每次合成消耗 5000 FE</grad><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7></grad></shadow>"
				"[间隔=3]"
				"- <shadow a=0.3><grad from=#FFFFFF to=#C7C7C7>每次制作间隔五秒</grad></shadow>"
				""
				"[!warn] 那些昂贵的锻造配方需要一大堆水晶，所以不提供。它们会留在你手中的锻造台里，功能完全正常。"
				""
				"[!note] 在 JEI 中查找控制器，查看哪些配方被包含在内。"
			]
			icon: "linggango_tweaks:tartaric_foundry"
			id: "072AE50C44090407"
			min_width: 340
			rewards: [{
				id: "36C63CB0FD5506C4"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.2d
			subtitle: "无限模式会出现错误"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "515D8C3E9421F7C1"
					item: "linggango_tweaks:tartaric_foundry"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "1CAAC28CC1119470"
					item: "linggango_tweaks:tartaric_foundry_item_input"
					type: "item"
				}
			]
			title: "塔塔里克的熔炉"
			x: 9.86d
			y: -0.52d
		}
	]
	title: "<shadow a=0.4><grad from=#C41E1E to=#FF9E9E f=0.6>血液魔法</grad></shadow>"
}
